{#
  BeMart admin レイアウト編集 — EC-CUBE goLayout (レイアウトデザイナー).

  PORT of EC-CUBE 4.3 admin-theme `Content/layout.twig`
  (src/Eccube/Resource/template/admin/Content/layout.twig).

  FORM/CRUD page (the drag-and-drop layout designer). Extends the admin
  frame (`admin-base.html.twig`). The markup skeleton + `c-*` / `ec-*` /
  Bootstrap classes are kept verbatim from EC-CUBE; only the dynamic
  bindings are rebound.

  FORM-PAGE recipe (Ray.WebFormModule — see var/templates/README.md): the
  Layout resource (src/Resource/Page/Admin/Layout/Layout.php — `onGet`
  renders the NEW-layout case, see its port header) exposes an
  {@see \MyVendor\BeMart\Form\AdminLayoutForm} as `body['form']`. The
  layout-name input renders through that real form object:
    {{ form.input('name')|raw }}     <- real <input> id `admin_layout_name`

  EC-CUBE-ism rebinding (see var/templates/README.md, "Admin pages"):
   - `{{ 'key'|trans }}`  -> the ja literal from messages.ja.yaml.
   - `url(route)`         -> deterministic `/{route}` (BeMartTwigExtension).
   - `form_widget(form._token)` -> EC-CUBE per-request CSRF widget. The
     hidden `_token` input is kept (structure) with an empty value;
     EC-CUBE-runtime only — enumerated as residual.
   - `form_widget(form.DeviceType)` -> the device-type select. The
     AdminLayoutForm declares only `name` (the new-layout case renders a
     select EC-CUBE builds from the DeviceType master, out of the Wave 9
     CMS slice); the select cell renders empty. Enumerated as residual.
   - `Layout.id` -> falsy here (the new-layout case): the preview-button
     JS block and the page-preview select are gated on `Layout.id` and
     are OMITTED. The conversion-area + designer canvas render with all
     sections empty (drag-and-drop placeholders).
   - `Layout.getBlockPositionsByTargetId(...)` / `UnusedBlocks` -> the
     per-layout block-position join is out of the Wave 9 CMS slice; every
     section loop falls through to its `{% else %}` placeholder, and the
     unused-block panel renders empty. Enumerated as residual —
     MISSING-BODY-FIELD: `Layout.blockPositions` / `unusedBlocks`.
   - `constant('Eccube\\Entity\\Layout::TARGET_ID_*')` -> EC-CUBE's
     section-id constants are inlined as their literal integer values
     (HEAD 1, BODY_AFTER 2, HEADER 3, CONTENTS_TOP 4, SIDE_LEFT 5,
     MAIN_TOP 6, MAIN_BOTTOM 7, SIDE_RIGHT 8, CONTENTS_BOTTOM 9,
     FOOTER 10, DRAWER 11, CLOSE_BODY_BEFORE 12, UNUSED 13).
   - the `layout_design.js` drag-drop runtime + the context-menu / modal
     JS -> client-side designer runtime; the markup shells are kept, the
     `{% block javascript %}` is reduced to the static section labels.
   - `{% form_theme %}` and the `auto_render` entity-extension loop ->
     Symfony form-theme / EC-CUBE entity-extension runtime. Dropped.
#}
{% extends 'admin-base.html.twig' %}

{% set route = 'admin_content_layout' %}
{% set title = 'レイアウト管理' %}
{% set sub_title = 'コンテンツ管理' %}

{% block javascript %}
    <script>
        var sections = {
            13 : '未使用ブロック',
            1 : '<head></head>タグ内',
            2 : '<body>タグ直後',
            3 : '#header',
            4 : '#contents_top',
            5 : '#side_left',
            6 : '#main_top',
            7 : '#main_bottom',
            8 : '#side_right',
            9 : '#contents_bottom',
            10 : '#footer',
            11 : '#drawer',
            12 : '</body>タグ直前'
        };
    </script>
{% endblock javascript %}

{% block main %}
    <form name="form1" id="form1" method="post" action="{{ layoutId|default('') ? url('admin_content_layout_edit', {id: layoutId}) : url('admin_content_layout_new') }}">
        <input type="hidden" id="admin_layout__token" name="_token" value="{{ csrfToken|default(csrf_token('bemart')) }}">
        <div class="c-contentsArea__cols">
            <div class="c-contentsArea__primaryCol">
                <div class="c-primaryCol">
                    <div class="card rounded border-0 mb-4">
                        <div class="card-header">
                            <div class="row">
                                <div class="col-8"><span class="card-title">レイアウト概要</span></div>
                                <div class="col-4 text-end"><a data-bs-toggle="collapse" href="#layoutOverview" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="layoutOverview"><i class="fa fa-angle-up fa-lg"></i></a></div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="collapse show ec-cardCollapse" id="layoutOverview">
                            <div class="card-body">
                                <div class="row mb-2">
                                    <div class="col-3 pe-0"><span>レイアウト名</span><span class="badge bg-primary ms-1">必須</span></div>
                                    <div class="col">
                                        {{ form.input('name')|raw }}
                                        {% if form.error('name') %}<span class="invalid-feedback d-block">{{ form.error('name') }}</span>{% endif %}
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="row mb-2">
                                    <div class="col-3 pe-0"><span>端末種別</span></div>
                                    <div class="col">
                                        <span>
                                        </span>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="card rounded border-0 mb-4">
                        <div class="card-header">
                            <div class="row">
                                <div class="col-8">
                                    <div class="d-inline-block" data-bs-toggle="tooltip" data-bs-placement="top" title="テンプレートのセクションごとにブロックをドラッグ＆ドロップで配置することができます。"><span class="card-title">レイアウト編集</span><i class="fa fa-question-circle fa-lg ms-1"></i></div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="col-4 text-end"><a data-bs-toggle="collapse" href="#layoutBlockEdit" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="layoutBlockEdit"><i class="fa fa-angle-up fa-lg"></i></a></div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="collapse show ec-cardCollapse" id="layoutBlockEdit">
                            <div class="card-body">
                                <div class="row">
                                    <div class="col p-2">
                                        <div class="d-block border border-ec-gray">
                                            <div id="position_1"
                                                 class="d-block p-3 border border-ec-gray border-top-0 border-end-0 border-start-0 ui-sortable">
                                                <p class="fw-bold mb-2"><head></head>タグ内</p>
                                                <div class="target-placeholder d-block text-center border-ec-dashed p-3"><span class="text-ec-gray">ブロックをドラッグ＆ドロップ</span></div>
                                            </div>
                                            <div id="position_2"
                                                 class="d-block p-3 border border-ec-gray border-top-0 border-end-0 border-start-0 ui-sortable">
                                                <p class="fw-bold mb-2"><body>タグ直後</p>
                                                <div class="target-placeholder d-block text-center border-ec-dashed p-3"><span class="text-ec-gray">ブロックをドラッグ＆ドロップ</span></div>
                                            </div>
                                            <div id="position_3"
                                                 class="d-block p-3 border border-ec-gray border-top-0 border-end-0 border-start-0 ui-sortable">
                                                <p class="fw-bold mb-2">#header</p>
                                                <div class="target-placeholder d-block text-center border-ec-dashed p-3"><span class="text-ec-gray">ブロックをドラッグ＆ドロップ</span></div>
                                            </div>
                                            <div id="position_4"
                                                 class="d-block p-3 border border-ec-gray border-top-0 border-end-0 border-start-0 ui-sortable">
                                                <p class="fw-bold mb-2">#contents_top</p>
                                                <div class="target-placeholder d-block text-center border-ec-dashed p-3"><span class="text-ec-gray">ブロックをドラッグ＆ドロップ</span></div>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="d-block ps-3 pe-3">
                                                <div class="row">
                                                    <div class="col align-items-start p-3 border border-ec-gray border-top-0 border-start-0">
                                                        <div id="position_5"
                                                             class="d-block ui-sortable">
                                                            <p class="fw-bold mb-2">#side_left</p>
                                                            <div class="target-placeholder d-block text-center border-ec-dashed p-3"><span class="text-ec-gray">ブロックをドラッグ＆ドロップ</span></div>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="col align-items-start ps-0 pe-0 border border-ec-gray border-top-0 border-start-0 border-bottom-0">
                                                        <div class="d-block h-100">
                                                            <div id="position_6"
                                                                 class="d-block p-3 border border-ec-gray border-top-0 border-start-0 border-end-0 ui-sortable">
                                                                <p class="fw-bold mb-2">#main_top</p>
                                                                <div class="target-placeholder d-block text-center border-ec-dashed p-3"><span class="text-ec-gray">ブロックをドラッグ＆ドロップ</span></div>
                                                            </div>
                                                            <div class="d-block p-3 border border-ec-gray border-top-0 border-start-0 border-end-0 bg-ec-lightGray">
                                                                <div class="d-block text-center p-3">
                                                                    <p class="fw-bold mb-2">Main</p>
                                                                </div>
                                                            </div>
                                                            <div id="position_7"
                                                                 class="d-block p-3 border border-ec-gray border-top-0 border-start-0 border-end-0 ui-sortable">
                                                                <p class="fw-bold mb-2">#main_bottom</p>
                                                                <div class="target-placeholder d-block text-center border-ec-dashed p-3"><span class="text-ec-gray">ブロックをドラッグ＆ドロップ</span></div>
                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                    <div class="col align-items-start ps-0 border border-ec-gray border-top-0 border-start-0 border-end-0">
                                                        <div id="position_8"
                                                             class="d-block p-3 h-100 ui-sortable">
                                                            <p class="fw-bold mb-2">#side_right</p>
                                                            <div class="target-placeholder d-block text-center border-ec-dashed p-3"><span class="text-ec-gray">ブロックをドラッグ＆ドロップ</span></div>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
